#section[Professional Summary]

Backend Engineer with 6 years of experience in software development, specializing in building scalable, reliable, and high-performance web applications. Experienced in NodeJS, NestJS, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Redis, Prisma, and BullMQ, with hands-on experience designing RESTful APIs, database optimization, caching strategies, background job processing, and asynchronous workflows.


