*Template.net* is an AI-powered browser-based content creation platform serving 10M+ users, offering collaborative editors for graphics, documents, and whiteboards.

- Developed and maintained a web-based graphic editor using React, TypeScript.
- Built scalable frontend architectures using micro-frontends and Module Federation.
- Developed the homepage using NextJSs, implementing rendering strategies and caching for performance and SEO.
- Developed REST APIs and backend services using NodeJS, NestJS, and MySQL.
- Implemented real-time collaboration using WebSockets for multi-user editing.
- Worked on an asynchronous export pipeline for generating PNG, JPEG, PDF, and MP4 outputs.
- Optimized frontend rendering, bundle size, and application performance.
- Integrated Redis caching to improve backend efficiency.
- Built CI/CD pipelines using GitHub Actions, AWS authentication through OIDC, and frontend deployment.
- Collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver end-to-end product features.
- Used AI-assisted tools such as GitHub Copilot and Claude Code to improve development speed and code quality.

